title: "BiLing: A Native Local-LLM Pinyin Input Method for macOS"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "BiLing contributors"
version: 1.2.0
date-released: 2026-07-27
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/shoal-rat/BiLing"
url: "https://github.com/shoal-rat/BiLing"
keywords:
  - pinyin
  - input method
  - macOS
  - local LLM
  - Qwen
abstract: >-
  BiLing combines an indexed 1.44-million-entry Pinyin lexicon, an incremental
  Pinyin lattice, encrypted local learning, and a mandatory on-device
  Qwen3-0.6B ranker in a native InputMethodKit architecture.
